"1_2": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "Bang\n\nThe sound of stage light draws out a circle zone on the weirdly glittering blueish curtain\n\nThe sound of acclaimed gentle man  claps reached across the theater hall.\nHe walks out of the stage, eyes glancing down at the audience, his face half lit.\n\nHe stands in the light zone, his height too tall so, with the lower part of his face bathed in light.\nHe harrumphed.\nStage Manager speaks before the performance begins.\n\nSILENCESSSs, everyone.\n\nIn a gentle yet coarse voice, as if he is trying to hide something.\n\nWe are now hopping upon a wonderful fairy-tale story that I'm sure you've never heard before.\n\nWithout further ado...\nLet the show begin.\n\nThe man still keep his gaze downward, waiting for your response",
"options": {0: {"text": "Ready / yes",
"link": "3_8",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
1: {"text": "Not ready / no",
"link": "3_4",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
2: {"text": "Takeover after retries",
"link": "3_49",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])}},
"offset": Vector2(3170.0,2500.0),
