"1_16": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "You read your lines out again\n\nI want to create stories people can gather around and remember.\n\nA lovely ambition.\n\nThat's lovely, dear, but I hope you won't get overwhelmed by the sheer pain in your fingers and getting calluses, writing so much with you.",
