"1_17": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "I'll be fine.\n\nBy the time, I will make more happy people reading my books than caring about the little bumps, pain in my finger.\n\nACTOR 1 smiles.\n\nGreat. Now go on.\n\nWe should have a lot of work to do before your birthday comes.\n\nMe and father are gonna organize a big party.\n\nWe're gonna invite people all around the kingdom to visit, to attend your own birthday.\n\nPreparations begin throughout the kingdom.\nThe princess's eighteenth birthday is approaching.\nIn this world, reaching eighteen is not only a birthday.\nIt is also the moment when a young person stands before the people around them and announces the social position, vocation, or path they intend to follow as an adult.\n\nThe bluish hue of  the curtain slightly takes on the tin of yellow, it push the player back to the main menu.",
"options": {0: {"text": "Continue the game",
"link": "3_18",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
1: {"text": "Quit the game",
"link": "3_46",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])}},
