"1_18": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "Before you can start the game, on the second screen, you see a spark of light cast on a thin long lines. It runs through quickly before disappear. It happens almost immediate.\n\nAnd then the Stage manager standing from the other side (on your computer), elegantly walk out, still with his despise look on you.\n\nOne month passes.\nThe day of the celebration finally arrives.\nPeople from around the kingdom gather for the princess's birthday and declaration.\n\nThe hall is crowded.\nMusicians prepare.\nServants and performers move around the stage.\nThe princess is preparing to appear before everyone.\n\nBoth of the actors, including the one you are controlling, walks out.\n\nActor 1 approaches you from the side, gently nudge the MC elbow.\n\nLook at that, child.\nToday is the day.\nI can not believe it.\nYou're gonna be a true adult.\n\nThe MC girl, ironically look confused, she keeps staring at the actor. But not for long because the cue has again appear on the other side.",
