"1_19": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "What, I am sure you can do great things. You are the Millers.\nYou are destined to be a great figure since you were born.\n\nShe looks toward the crowded entrance.\n\nBut don't you think it's getting difficult to move through there.\n\nHow about we take a detour from the main gate. Which entrance should we use?\n\nAs you tried to look on your phone, expect a line, something else happen.\nThe staff hands out a very sketchy unfinished writing, the ink droplet can be seen on the while board.\n\nThe cue card does not contain a sentence this time.\n\nThe Actor and the audience are waiting for you",
