"1_29": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "ACTOR 1 straightens your dress, while waiting for the man to rush to their place.\nThe light of the stage focus on them as everything else start to fall into the dark.\n\nRight. Now. Before you make the declaration\n\nI just want to make some confirmation.\n\nShe swiftly leaves her breadth out, take a slow moment before she continues\n\nYou'll tell everyone that you're entering the writing profession, won't you?\n\nShe looks at you attentively.\n\nAll the eyes of the audience are casting upon YOU. (including the MC)/\n\nYou wait for the cue.\n\nNothing.\n\nACTOR 1 looks at you expectantly, eyes landing on you waiting for your next move.\n\nThen, late, the card changes.",
"options": {0: {"text": "Yes",
"link": "3_30",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
1: {"text": "No",
"link": "3_32",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
2: {"text": "Uncertain",
"link": "3_33",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
3: {"text": "Changed my mind",
"link": "3_31",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
4: {"text": "Takeover after retries",
"link": "3_66",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])}},
