"1_34": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "After the 2 actor ends there lines, there is something causing chaos among the audience.\n\nAn arouse of noise. It heats up the stage below.\n\nThe 2 actors observe the confusion below. The light tosed on them earlier leaves intact, as if being trapped inside the circle.\n\nJust as everything can go more unexpected, a mysterious man marches onto the stage confidently, wearing formal attire that of a village chief.\n\nYet, the actor's face stiffens, she backs down a few steps.",
"options": {0: {"text": "Continues.",
"link": "3_35",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])}},
