"1_35": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "He does not look at her.\n\nHe looks directly at you.\n\nA princess.\n\nA writer.\n\nHer daughter.\n\nA pause.\n\nIs that who you are?\n\nYour phone vibrates.\n\nYou notice the stage manager himself now holds the cue board himself, writing the lines in red ink, capitalised the letter in an exaggerated tone.\n\nBefore you can react, Actor 2 continues.",
