't hear you well. Repeat again.\"}, \"TECHNICAL_FAILURE\": {\"action\": \"stay\", \"reply\": \"Stage Manager: Hello? I can't hear you well. Repeat again.\"}}, \"template_version\": 2, \"conversation\": \"A3_2_FirstQuestion\", \"intro_exempt\": false, \"takeover_start\": \"TAKEOVER::A3_2_FirstQuestion\", \"mic_check_reply\": \"Stage Manager: It seems some cat has stolen your tongue. Do you mind checking your “device” again?\"}",
