"1_40": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "The Stage manager makes a morse code light signal, pointing towards Actor 1.\n\nIt takes her 3 seconds, before stepping between you and the guy. pushing him to the side.\n\nThe music in the hall speeds up.\n\nEnough.\n\nHer decision has been made.\n\nWe are here to celebrate my daughter's eighteenth birthday and declaration.\n\nActor 2 looks past her.\n\nThen let her tell us herself.\n\nYour phone vibrates again.",
"options": {0: {"text": "Continue.",
"link": "3_41",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])}},
"offset": Vector2(7470.0,11950.0),
"size": Vector2(310,420)},
