"1_41": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "Actor 2 steps closer, marching towards the MC, ignoring actor 1 who is trying to keep the performance alive.\n\nWhy writing?\n\nhe raise the stake, abruptly cutting the ACTOR 1's line\n\nBecause you love it?\n\nOr because someone handed you the answer?\n\nActor turns around and  reaches toward you.\n\nDarling.\n\nIgnore him.\n\nThe guests are waiting.\n\nFor the first time, there is no single obvious instruction.",
"options": {0: {"text": "Follow Actor 1 / continue ceremony",
"link": "3_43",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
1: {"text": "Answer Actor 2 / explain why writing",
"link": "3_42",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])},
