"1_42": {"speaker": "",
"dialogue": "You turn toward Actor 2 instead.\n\nACTOR 1 freezes.\n\nFor a moment, nobody backstage seems to know what to do.\n\nActor 2 lowers his voice.\n\nGood.\n\nYou heard that Karl. You can't help hiding it forever.\n\nYelled, But he does not look at the audience, at MC, at actor 1. Rather, he turns himself at a pointblank space on the screen",
"options": {0: {"text": "Continue.",
"link": "3_45",
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([])}},
"offset": Vector2(9630.0,11950.0),
"size": Vector2(310,420)},
